---

Install [Machines](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/final-adventure-machines) on NeoForge **1.21.1**.

This is a factory pack that still wants you to fight. Follow the quests. Custom recipes and relics point bosses at machines on purpose.

First session: a hole, a cobble gen or a simple Create setup, then the first quest that mentions a boss. Do not build a perfect base for two hours. The line will move.

Magic (Ars) and Cataclysm sit on the same timeline as the belts. If you ignore one of those, the next chapter will ask for an item you cannot make.

The End is crafted. Mechanical Crafting is the gate. You will not luck into a portal. [Cataclysm DeDust](/mods/cataclysm-dedust) is the eat-the-boss-dust addon sitting next to those fights.
